THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS AND SBOM

The container images used by this bundle are pinned in the compose files and are
listed, together with every npm production dependency and its licence text, in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md at the root of this distribution. A machine-readable
CycloneDX inventory of the same set is in sbom.json.

Both are regenerated on every release rather than maintained by hand.
